Novalex Studios — press kit media licence
=========================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Novalex Studios. All rights reserved.

This repository publishes press kits for games by Novalex Studios. The
following grant applies to the media distributed here — screenshots, animated
GIFs, capsule art, logos, icons and the per-language asset packs.


GRANT

Novalex Studios grants press, content creators and streamers permission to use
screenshots, GIFs, capsule art and other media from these press kits for
coverage of the games they describe, including in monetised video, without
further permission required.


EXCLUSION — TRAILER FOOTAGE

This grant does not extend to frames or clips from any game's trailer video.
Trailer footage is excluded pending confirmation of a third-party asset's
licensing and must not be used under this grant.


WHAT IS NOT COVERED

This grant covers the media in this repository only. It conveys no rights in
the games themselves, their source code, their trademarks, or any Novalex
Studios name or logo beyond identifying the game being covered. Third-party
components used in the production of these assets remain governed by their own
licences.

Questions, and requests that fall outside this grant: studios.novalex@gmail.com
